docs/cli.rst:9182: 240 chars: Column types will be automatically detected in CSV or TSV data, as described in :ref:`cli_insert_csv_tsv`. You can pass the ``--no-detect-types`` option to disable this automatic type detection and treat all CSV and TSV columns as ``TEXT``.
